And one of the earliest ones came from OpenAI and others that described it as AI systems

05:14.879 --> 05:18.160
that can do work for you independently.

05:18.160 --> 05:21.480
This is the idea behind products like GPT agent

05:21.480 --> 05:23.480
that used to be called Operator.

