reservation while you watch. And you have that sense that there is something there that's working

05:46.160 --> 05:53.839
autonomously. And that is the sense of having an AI agent that is doing work. Some other people

05:53.839 --> 05:57.879
use a similar definition and that it's something that can act as well

05:57.879 --> 06:06.240
as generating tokens. It is an LLM that can act. Which, you know, it's hard to be super

06:06.240 --> 06:10.279
crisp about what that means, but you kind of know it when you see it. And that was the

06:10.279 --> 06:22.240
first of the definitions of an AI agent. And then the next one came in, I guess, early 2025. And I think it was hugging face, first of all, that the New Yorker AI starts up.

06:22.240 --> 06:29.540
The described it as AI systems where an LLM controls the workflow.

06:29.540 --> 06:31.220
And LLM controls the workflow.

06:31.220 --> 06:36.500
So an LLM as it's generating output tokens, those tokens describe what should happen next,

06:36.500 --> 06:41.399
and orchestrate future LLM calls. That became the definition,

06:41.399 --> 06:43.480
and anthropic and a double-down on that

06:43.480 --> 06:46.980
with a seminal blog post called Building Effective Agents

06:46.980 --> 06:48.519
that had a similar definition,

06:48.519 --> 06:50.439
and that for a long time was like

06:50.439 --> 06:53.319
the prevailing definition of an AI agent.

06:53.319 --> 06:56.740
But more recently, the definition that's really taken hold

06:56.740 --> 06:58.839
that's become the definition

06:58.839 --> 07:01.600
that I think Simon Willison, who I mentioned before,

07:01.600 --> 07:03.600
was perhaps the first

07:03.600 --> 07:08.120
to really sort of plant the flag and say, "This is going to be the definition."

07:08.120 --> 07:16.839
It came in late 2025, and it is that an agent is where there is an allalam that runs tools

07:16.839 --> 07:20.319
in a loop to achieve a goal.

07:20.319 --> 07:29.000
It runs tools in a loop to achieve a goal. So it ties back to a couple of those tricks that I just mentioned.

07:29.000 --> 07:30.699
Tools and loop.

07:30.699 --> 07:32.000
I've heard something.

